From 7b2d4e9a1c6f8035d2e7a9b1c4f60d8e3a5b7c91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <a@b>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 21:10:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: stub the 12 overlay 0 ARM helpers (lib/NitroDWC asm) instead of seeding them

Patch 0168 seeded 12 ov00_* names, but the maploader only indexes pokeheartgold-slop/asm/*.s ("seed not found in assembly"):
they are arm_func_start in lib/NitroDWC/asm/overlay_00_arm.s, which it does not scan. Take the 12 seeds back out of seeds.json
and define them as Missing() traps in missing.c (like ov00_021EC294) so the link succeeds; the Global Terminal path logs
[SS-MISSING] if it reaches one. Translating them for real needs port.py to index overlay_00_arm.s (follow-up).
---
 2 files changed, 13 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

